{"id":"01a03c69-4dc0-7b10-88c5-0e4ba64e039e","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.5.5.1.3","event_type":"updated","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"{\"id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.5.5.1.3\",\"title\":\"LOCAL_EVIDENCE_LIFETIME tracking (1200s)\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"assignee\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"owner\":\"me@mark.atwood.name\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:41:41.369984Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-26T04:46:57.730972Z\",\"started_at\":\"2026-08-26T04:46:57.730972Z\",\"lease_expires_at\":\"2026-08-26T04:51:57.730972Z\",\"heartbeat_at\":\"2026-08-26T04:46:57.730972Z\",\"dependencies\":[{\"issue_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.5.5.1.3\",\"depends_on_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.5.5.1\",\"type\":\"parent-child\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:41:41.936887Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"metadata\":\"{}\"}]}","new_value":"{\"notes\":\"Implemented a non-dead, publicly exported Python local-evidence tracker on clean paths. LOCAL_EVIDENCE_LIFETIME_SECONDS is exactly 1200; callers refresh authenticated announce/rrep/rpl/data observations and cannot inject expiry. Tracker uses a monotonic u64 time domain, rejects regressions/expiry overflow atomically, expires at equality, refreshes for a full new lifetime, defaults to a bounded 32-peer table, refuses silent live eviction, and reuses expired slots. Added normative spec text plus dedicated closed schema and deterministic 7-scenario operation vectors. Green: 18 focused pytest, ruff, mypy, JSON/schema validation, git diff check; read-only cargo check -p lichen-core --no-default-features. Rust lib/loadng files were concurrently dirty and untouched, as were Python routing/dodag/loadng. No codereview/commit/push.\"}","created_at":"2026-08-26T04:52:09.280726Z"}
